3338000/extras/04dec9e8ea1be6feb488316daa5f1d92.avif?t=1745143425\" data-has-big width=800 height=158 /></span><strong> </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for hidden websites, encrypted messages, and secret files that connect the game\u2019s mystery to the real world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve ARG challenges to unlock additional in-game content,  lore, and hidden paths in the story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338000/extras/38a2a165292c208fe885851e1cef0eff.webp?t=1745143425\" width=604 height=1 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world that hides the truth is a world waiting to be hacked. Will you take control, or become just another victim of the system?</strong></p>",
